BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Really Me
DTSTART:20250823T180000Z
DTEND:20250823T194000Z
DTSTAMP:20250823T180000Z
UID:245nqwxjK5
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 76 mins (1h16m)\n\nPresented by Kinetic Village. Rea
 lly Me: The Diary of a Soul In Transition follows Megan's journey transiti
 oning at age 46 after decades of hiding her true identity. Supported by he
 r wife Kari and children\, Megan navigates legal changes\, finds acceptanc
 e at her progressive church\, and discovers community in queer spaces. Thr
 ough losses and gains—including performing burlesque and starting a quee
 r karate class—she develops a theology reconciling her Christian faith w
 ith her transgender identity\, finding beauty in transformation.\n\nhttps:
 //www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/really-me-the-diary-of-a-soul-in-transit
 ion
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
