BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Boys Go to Jupiter
DTSTART:20250823T230000Z
DTEND:20250824T005000Z
DTSTAMP:20250823T230000Z
UID:c0L5Xpip8d
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nSet in the liminal period between
  Christmas and New Year’s\, Boys Go to Jupiter follows the adventures of
  Billy 5000\, a teenage gig worker with a rise-and-grind mindset whose que
 st to make $5\,000 is derailed by the appearance of a gelatinous little du
 de from outer space. Dreamy\, surreal\, and filled with visionary animatio
 n and beautiful songs\, Boys Go to Jupiter is the feature-film debut of ac
 claimed 3D animator Julian Glander\, whose work has been featured everywhe
 re from {adult swim} to video games to the pages of the New Yorker.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/boys-go-to-jupiter
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Boys Go to Jupiter
DTSTART:20250824T013000Z
DTEND:20250824T032000Z
DTSTAMP:20250824T013000Z
