DESCRIPTION:Duration: 94 mins (1h34m)\n\nThe Popcorn List Mile-high hair. 
 Synthesized music. Underground parties. Elizabeth Ai’s lively first feat
 ure delves into the rebellious Vietnamese new wave blending nostalgia with
  a deeply personal re-examination of her community's music scene\, hidden 
 and unexamined past.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/the-popco
 rn-list/new-wave
